<!-- 足迹详情：旅行记录册信息层级 + 1～9 张原比例照片 + 底部安全区操作。 -->
<template name="detail-photo">
  <view class="photo-frame {{extraClass}}">
    <image
      wx:if="{{!item.failed}}"
      class="photo-image"
      src="{{item.url}}"
      mode="widthFix"
      lazy-load="{{true}}"
      show-menu-by-longpress="{{true}}"
      data-index="{{item.index}}"
      aria-label="{{item.ariaLabel}}"
      bindload="onPhotoLoad"
      binderror="onPhotoError"
      bindtap="onPreviewPhoto"
    />
    <view wx:else class="photo-fallback" role="img" aria-label="{{item.ariaLabel}}加载失败">
      <text>图片暂时无法显示</text>
    </view>
  </view>
</template>

<view class="page">
  <image class="page-bg" src="/assets/bg/page-paper-ink.jpg" mode="aspectFill" />
  <mock-badge />

  <view class="state" wx:if="{{loading}}">
    <text class="fp-hint">正在展开这段旅程…</text>
  </view>

  <view class="state" wx:elif="{{notFound}}">
    <view class="state-text">记录不存在或已被删除</view>
    <button class="fp-btn-plain state-btn" bindtap="onBack">返回</button>
  </view>

  <view class="state" wx:elif="{{networkError}}">
    <view class="state-text">网络异常，请检查网络后重试</view>
    <view class="state-btns">
      <button class="fp-btn-primary state-btn" bindtap="onRetryLoad">重试</button>
      <button class="fp-btn-plain state-btn" bindtap="onBack">返回</button>
    </view>
  </view>

  <block wx:elif="{{fp}}">
    <view class="content">
      <view class="head">
        <text class="date-kicker">{{dateText}}</text>
        <text class="place-title">{{fp.place}}</text>
        <text wx:if="{{regionText}}" class="region-line">{{regionText}}</text>
        <text wx:if="{{auxiliaryText}}" class="auxiliary-line">{{auxiliaryText}}</text>
        <view
          wx:if="{{isLocalDraft}}"
          class="publish-state publish-state--{{publishState}}"
          bindtap="onPublishStateTap"
        >
          <view class="publish-state__copy">
            <text class="publish-state__title">{{publishStatusTitle}}</text>
            <text class="publish-state__text">{{publishStatusText}}</text>
          </view>
          <text wx:if="{{publishStatusAction}}" class="publish-state__action">{{publishStatusAction}}</text>
        </view>
        <view wx:if="{{editFailed}}" class="edit-failed-badge" bindtap="onRetryEdit">
          <text>{{editError || '修改未保存成功'}} · 点击处理</text>
        </view>
      </view>

      <view wx:if="{{photoCount > 0}}" class="detail-section photo-section">
        <view class="section-heading">
          <text class="section-title">今日影像</text>
          <text class="section-count">{{photoCountText}}</text>
        </view>

        <view wx:if="{{photoLoading}}" class="photo-loading">正在展开照片…</view>

        <block wx:if="{{!photoLoading}}">
          <template wx:if="{{mainPhoto}}" is="detail-photo" data="{{item: mainPhoto, extraClass: 'photo-frame--main'}}" />

          <view wx:if="{{stackPhotos.length}}" class="photo-stack">
            <block wx:for="{{stackPhotos}}" wx:key="index">
              <template is="detail-photo" data="{{item: item, extraClass: 'photo-frame--full'}}" />
            </block>
          </view>

          <view wx:if="{{photoLeft.length || photoRight.length}}" class="photo-columns">
            <view class="photo-column">
              <block wx:for="{{photoLeft}}" wx:key="index">
                <template is="detail-photo" data="{{item: item, extraClass: 'photo-frame--column'}}" />
              </block>
            </view>
            <view class="photo-column">
              <block wx:for="{{photoRight}}" wx:key="index">
                <template is="detail-photo" data="{{item: item, extraClass: 'photo-frame--column'}}" />
              </block>
            </view>
          </view>
        </block>
      </view>

      <view wx:if="{{fp.note}}" class="detail-section note-section">
        <view class="section-heading">
          <text class="section-title">此刻</text>
        </view>
        <text class="note-text">{{fp.note}}</text>
      </view>

      <view class="detail-section info-section">
        <view class="info-card">
          <view class="section-heading info-heading">
            <text class="section-title">足迹信息</text>
          </view>
          <view class="info-row">
            <text class="info-label">日期</text>
            <text class="info-value">{{dateText}}</text>
          </view>
          <view class="info-row">
            <text class="info-label">地区</text>
            <text class="info-value">{{regionText || '未记录'}}</text>
          </view>
          <view class="info-row info-row--last">
            <text class="info-label">照片</text>
            <text class="info-value">{{photoCountText}}</text>
          </view>
        </view>
      </view>

      <button wx:if="{{hasCoordinates && !isLocalDraft}}" class="map-entry" hover-class="map-entry--pressed" bindtap="onViewMap">
        <image class="map-entry__icon" src="/assets/icons/location-ink.png" mode="aspectFit" />
        <view class="map-entry__copy">
          <text class="map-entry__title">在地图中查看</text>
          <text class="map-entry__meta">{{regionText || fp.place}}</text>
        </view>
        <text class="map-entry__action">查看</text>
      </button>

      <view class="bottom-spacer"></view>
    </view>

    <view wx:if="{{!isLocalDraft}}" class="action-bar">
      <button class="action-btn action-btn--edit" hover-class="action-btn--pressed" bindtap="onEdit">
        <image class="action-btn__icon" src="/assets/icons/edit-ink.png" mode="aspectFit" />
        <text>编辑记录</text>
      </button>
      <button class="action-btn action-btn--delete" hover-class="action-btn--pressed" loading="{{deleting}}" disabled="{{deleting}}" bindtap="onDelete">
        <image class="action-btn__icon" src="/assets/icons/delete-vermilion.png" mode="aspectFit" />
        <text>删除</text>
      </button>
    </view>
    <view wx:elif="{{publishState === 'failed'}}" class="action-bar action-bar--single">
      <button class="action-btn action-btn--edit" hover-class="action-btn--pressed" bindtap="onPublishStateTap">
        <image class="action-btn__icon" src="/assets/icons/edit-ink.png" mode="aspectFit" />
        <text>修改内容后重新发布</text>
      </button>
    </view>
  </block>
</view>
